<h1>Product Catalog — RSC Streaming Demo</h1>

<p>
  This page demonstrates <strong>streaming with React Server Components</strong>.
  Watch the products appear, then reviews stream in progressively as each
  <code>&lt;Suspense&gt;</code> boundary resolves.
</p>

<p style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #6b7280;">
  💡 <strong>Tip:</strong> Open DevTools → Network tab to see that only AddToCart client
  component JS is loaded. All product rendering, date formatting, and price formatting
  stay on the server.
</p>

<%= stream_react_component('ProductCatalog', props: @product_catalog_props, prerender: true) %>

